00:00:45.599 --> 00:00:48.159
Inutusan niya ang Imperial Guards na i-escort siya pabalik.

00:00:48.599 --> 00:00:50.560
Ibibigay ba talaga ni Beile ang Seven Stars Lamp

00:00:50.560 --> 00:00:52.439
at He Fuyi sa Empress Dowager?

00:00:53.759 --> 00:00:55.639
Pagkatapos ang kanyang kasunduan sa iyo, Prinsipe,

00:00:56.439 --> 00:00:57.919
