00:02:39.440 --> 00:02:42.080
Nakuha na namin ang Spiritual Qi ng matandang babae.

00:02:42.600 --> 00:02:43.600
Ang ikapitong Big Dipper na bituin

00:02:43.639 --> 00:02:44.800
